# =============================================================================
# Safety .gitignore for the home directory.
#
# IMPORTANT: this folder (C:\Users\Aggarwal) is itself a git repo with a GitHub
# remote, and it USED to track the Desktop/tabula-medica project. Without these
# rules a `git add -A` would stage the service-account keys, EIN/tax PDFs, and
# access-key CSVs that live loose on the Desktop and push them to GitHub. These
# patterns block that.
#
# 2026-07-14: Desktop/tabula-medica is its OWN git repo (the canonical one). It
# was git-rm --cached out of this home repo and is now fully ignored below, so a
# stray `git push att` can never leak portal/PHI source into the Attentiva repo.
# =============================================================================

# ---- Credentials / keys — NEVER commit ----
*.pem
*.p12
*.key
*service-account*.json
*serviceaccount*.json
*-adminsdk-*.json
google-service-account.json
.cf-token.txt
*cf-token*.txt
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.sample

# ---- Canonical nested repo — never track from the home repo ----
# Desktop/tabula-medica is its own repo; ignoring it here decouples it entirely
# so it can't be re-staged or pushed to the `att` (Attentiva) remote by mistake.
/Desktop/tabula-medica/

# ---- Loose secret/personal files on the Desktop root ----
# (these hit files directly in Desktop\, e.g. leaked GCP/Firebase key dumps + docs)
/Desktop/*.json
/Desktop/*.csv
/Desktop/*.pdf
/Desktop/*.exe

# ---- Other home-dir secret stores ----
/.ssh/
/.secrets-quarantine/
/KEYS/
/.gnupg/
/.aws/
/.azure/
/.docker/

# ---- Credential-bearing tool/config dirs (gcloud ADC + tokens, browser data) ----
/.config/
/.cache/
/.local/
/AppData/
/.expo/
/.canvas/
/.cookiecutter_replay/

# ---- Tool credentials/state ----
/.claude/.credentials.json
/.claude.json
/.claude.json.backup
/.config/

# ---- Bulk / non-source ----
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
*.log
